A||||2||racefan||No oil pressure?? Or is there.....||||9||
Z||000000||racefan||10-20-2001||10:16 PM||||I noticed that my oil pressure reads zero. I am using a mechanical gauge so I thought maybe the gauge was bad so I disconnected it at the gauge figuring that I would see oil come out of the tube connected to the block.<BR>I started it and there was nothing. The funny thing is, the engine runs fine...no knock or rap, so it looks like the motor is getting oil. Could there be a blockage in the oil passage somewhere? Any ideas? Any other place to connect the gauge other than the side of the block?||||reg||9
Z||000001||rogergarrison||10-21-2001||06:04 AM||||seems to me most likely is the orifice in the oil sending unit may be plugged up, just replace it. If you werent getting oil, engine would lock up pretty quick. You can take off the oil fill cap and use a flashlite to look in valve cover to check oil flow visually too.<p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 10-21-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||Fierowrecker||10-21-2001||07:43 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by racefan:<BR><B>I noticed that my oil pressure reads zero. I am using a mechanical gauge so I thought maybe the gauge was bad so I disconnected it at the gauge figuring that I would see oil come out of the tube connected to the block.<BR>I started it and there was nothing. The funny thing is, the engine runs fine...no knock or rap, so it looks like the motor is getting oil. Could there be a blockage in the oil passage somewhere? Any ideas? Any other place to connect the gauge other than the side of the block?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>If I am understanding what you are saying, the gage did work, but quit...<BR>You removed the connection at the block, and ran the engine, but no oil came out the hole...<P>Sounds like the passage is plugged, try running a small diameter wire into the passage and see if it is plugged...<BR><P>------------------<BR>crash... The Fierowrecker<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://fiero.nl/uploads/crash_sig.jpg">        <IMG SRC="http://fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif"> ||||reg||1
